The corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y+2z&=-2 \\\\ y+2z&=-6 \\\\ z&=-2\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=-2 \\\\ y&=-6-(2)(-2)=-2 \\\\ x&=-2-(-2)(-2)-(2)(-2)=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -2,-2,-2\\rangle$." 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760743 1080 "x=-10,\\quad y=5,\\quad z=2" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760743 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760743 1083 #uuid "458e7415-61dc-520d-b953-a420474dddee" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760744 1080 "\\langle 6,-1,-4\\rangle" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760744 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760744 1083 #uuid "47d43134-ae72-5399-9bc1-0e6747c5cd93" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760745 1080 "\\langle -16,5,-4\\rangle" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760745 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760745 1083 #uuid "48c26eac-9bad-51ac-9d4b-59fdfbee99cc" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760746 1080 "\\langle -1,-2,0\\rangle" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760746 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760746 1083 #uuid "502fb675-1e35-515c-842b-3817ab9b1ce7" 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760747 1068 #edb/ref 17592186760759 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760747 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760747 1071 "Consider the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}3 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -4 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." 13194139547563 17592186576411 true] [17592186760747 1072 #uuid "593da203-f82a-5a4d